{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果周二在年度財務申報文件中表示，能夠以「意外或不可預測的方式」行事的AI智能體可能使公司面臨訴訟或損害其聲譽，從而對其業務構成威脅。蘋果申報文件中的新風險因素顯示了AI智能體的顛覆性潛力，這類智能體已迅速成為矽谷最重要公司高度關注的事項。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584956.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:46.869982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:44:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_hash":"c37273eef85ee6889c8a0714610129d4bbb2595121e32bca47ab6861920f9a13","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}